  "comparison": [
    "Glass: about 42 soft dots of 46-53 px at 14% opacity and 4 brighter dots at 17%, under a 165-degree tint and a 118-degree sheen with a 1 px top highlight. No constellation lines.",
    "Layout: the dashboard tab bar with Marimba active, then one centred column about 760-880 px wide. The header is a title, a mono status line and icon links. No side rail.",
    "Type: Archivo for prose, headings and controls; JetBrains Mono for ids, commands, numbers and status lines.",
    "Colour: the Forest palette with one accent, #F26A1B. Orange marks only the action that spends, an owner-review or blocked state, and warnings.",
    "Voice: the owner's messages are bubbles; Marimba's replies are bare text on the glass.",
    "Owner acts: always terminal lines with a copy icon, never a button, on every surface. The phone and the Mac app show none as runnable.",
    "Numbers are not compared. Bracketed values are placeholders and the run data is illustrative."
  ],
